# ============================================================================
# NOTE TO FUTURE SELF
# ============================================================================
#
# If you are reading this while expanding Agent 11:
#
#
#       DO NOT BEGIN BY ADDING MORE KUBERNETES OBJECTS
#       TO NetworkEndpointEvaluator.
