#
#
#       EXTERNAL_FM
#
#       COMPANY_CLOUD_LLM
#
#       COMPANY_ONPREM_LLM
#
#
# Those are Agent 11 routing domains.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# AKS != ROUTING DOMAIN
# ============================================================================
#
# Same rule.
#
#
# Azure-hosted Kubernetes infrastructure does not redefine Agent 11 routing
# semantics.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# GKE != ROUTING DOMAIN
# ============================================================================
#
# Same rule.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# OKE != ROUTING DOMAIN
# ============================================================================
#
# Same rule.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# KUBERNETES != CLOUD PROVIDER
# ============================================================================
#
# Kubernetes may run in:
#
#
#       AWS
#
#       Azure
#
#       GCP
#
#       OCI
#
#       private data centers
#
#       edge environments
#
#
# Therefore:
#
#
#       KUBERNETES
#           !=
#       CLOUD PROVIDER
#
#
# ============================================================================
# CLOUD PROVIDER != ROUTING DOMAIN
# ============================================================================
#
# Preserve:
#
#
#       COMPANY_CLOUD_LLM
#
#
# as a provider-neutral routing domain.
#
#
# Future company-controlled AI may run simultaneously in:
#
#
#       AWS
#
#       Azure
#
#       GCP
#
#       OCI
#
#
# without requiring:
#
#
#       COMPANY_AWS_LLM
#
#       COMPANY_AZURE_LLM
#
#       COMPANY_GCP_LLM
#
#
# merely to describe deployment provider.
