#
# Examples:
#
#
#       API reachable / data plane unreachable
#
#       API unreachable / data plane reachable
#
#       both unreachable
#
#
# This validates separate evidence dimensions.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# ENDPOINT OBSERVATION != PATH OBSERVATION
# ============================================================================
#
# Preserve.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — CLIENT LOCATION
# ============================================================================
#
# Endpoint can exist globally while reachability depends upon:
#
#
#       Agent 11 location
#
#       cluster
#
#       region
#
#       network attachment
#
#
# This reinforces:
#
#
#       endpoint evidence
#
#           !=
#       path evidence.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — PATH-SPECIFIC ENDPOINT
