#
#       string
#
#
# if future behavior needs structured identity.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — ENDPOINT URI
# ============================================================================
#
# A URI may include:
#
#
#       scheme
#
#       host
#
#       port
#
#       path
#
#
# But gateways may mean:
#
#
#       path
#
#
# selects logical service rather than network endpoint.
#
#
# Be careful defining endpoint identity around complete URI.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — SECRETS IN ENDPOINT STRINGS
# ============================================================================
#
# Never allow:
#
#
#       API key
#
#       bearer token
#
#       credentials
#
#
# to become part of endpoint identity.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# ENDPOINT != CREDENTIAL
# ============================================================================
#
# Preserve.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — CREDENTIAL OWNERSHIP
# ============================================================================
#
# Client/authentication configuration belongs to:
#
#
#       invocation/runtime composition
#
#
# not endpoint domain identity.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — KUBERNETES Secrets
# ============================================================================
#
