#
# Endpoint observer sees resulting backend set.
#
#
# It does not own scaling behavior.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# OBSERVE SCALE != CONTROL SCALE
# ============================================================================
#
# Preserve.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — KEDA
# ============================================================================
#
# AI workloads may scale on:
#
#
#       queue depth
#
#       custom metrics
#
#
# Again:
#
#
#       scaling semantics != endpoint semantics.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — SERVERLESS KUBERNETES
# ============================================================================
#
# Some infrastructure may abstract Nodes away.
#
#
# Endpoint semantics should survive runtime changes.
#
#
# ============================================================================
# FUTURE QUESTION — KNATIVE / SERVERLESS INFERENCE
